# Samvidhan environment example
# This project is fully static and keyless by design. No secrets are required
# for local development, CI, or production. This file exists to document that
# decision and to keep the .env.* naming convention documented per project
# configuration standards. If a future phase adds a variable (for example a
# Cloudflare API token for wrangler during Phase 3 evaluation), document it
# here first, never commit real values.
